Class	Purpose
File	Represents a file or directory (create, delete, check existence, etc.)

FileReader	Reads text files character by character

BufferedReader	Reads text efficiently, line by line

FileWriter	Writes characters to a text file

BufferedWriter	Writes text efficiently using buffering

PrintWriter	Easy formatted text output

Scanner	Reads text from files or keyboard

FileInputStream	Reads binary data (images, PDFs, etc.)

FileOutputStream	Writes binary data

BufferReaderInputStream Reads binary data

BufferReaderOutputStream Write binary data


ObjectInputStream	Reads serialized Java objects

ObjectOutputStream	Writes serialized Java objects

